[
    {
        "text": "\u7b2c\u4e09\u5341\u4e8c\u5173\uff08\u524d\uff09",
        "tag": "header",
        "key": "title_test",
        "is_skippable": true,
        "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_lungmen_m",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$mist_loop",
        "key": "$mist_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "At this point... we're out of other options. Madam Ch'en, if you deny my request...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island will act alone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "These actions don't violate any of the terms of our cooperation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course we'll be there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Is that so...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "In that case, thank you on behalf of Rhodes Island...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know that Lungmen still sees us as Infected...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not a big deal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, I'm not sure if our squads will be able to make it into the ruins.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll have to play it by ear.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the situation allows, we will definitely help.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, our top priority is still to eliminate Reunion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That... that's enough for us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Thank you, Madam Ch'en.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, I have my own duties.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you hear me, Doc?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "We will join up with Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, be careful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "This won't be a simple task.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, I've managed to put together some pieces of intel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island has already deployed rescue squads to assist the other recon squads.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "But Meteorite's squad is too far and we cannot reach them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is where you come in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Only Meteorite's squad...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand. I'll go look for them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll send you the coordinates later.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Remember, safety is your top priority.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
